{"hw":"δέκα","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">δέκα</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δέκα</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">οἱ</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">αἱ</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τά</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">indecl.</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">ten,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.372</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.160</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">οἱ δ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the Ten,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.6</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ τῶν δ. τυραννίς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ath.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">41.2</span> </span>; also <span class=\"gk\">οἱ δ.</span> the <b class=\"lex-tr\">Attic Orators,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philostr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VS</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1.14</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰ δέκα [ἔτη] ἀφ' ἥβης</span> those who are <b class=\"lex-tr\">ten</b> years past <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20</span> </span> (the age of military service), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.4.23</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δ. ἄνδρες,</span> <abbr>=</abbr> Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">decemviri,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">App.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hann.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">56</span> </span>: compds. (not in early writers, but usu. in Hellenistic Gr.) <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">δεκα-είς</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tab.Heracl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.34</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Num.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span>:</div></div>"}